OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 23, dies in hospital
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died in hospital
OL,7,Fafter being involved in a collision
OL,8,Fwith a lorry on Monday.
OL,10,FA red Volvo lorry heading northbound
OL,11,Fcollided with a black Kawasaki
OL,12,Fmotorbike going in the opposite
OL,13,Fdirection on the B1043 Old North Road
OL,14,Fin Sawtry, Cambridgeshire, at about
OL,15,F12:50 BST.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist, a 23-year-old man
OL,18,Ffrom Yaxley, near Peterborough, was
OL,19,Ftaken to Addenbrooke's Hospital, in
OL,20,FCambridge, with life-threatening
OL,21,Finjuries but has since died, police
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
